<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Magis TV</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #1f2328;
            background-color: #fdfaf6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px 16px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 880px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 48px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(239, 136, 5, 0.08);
            border: 2px solid #feedd8;
        }
        .header-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #ef8805;
        }
        .logo-badge {
            background-color: #ef8805;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 24px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ef8805;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .date {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #222222;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        h2::before {
            content: "";
            display: inline-block;
            width: 6px;
            height: 24px;
            background: #ef8805;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333333;
            margin: 14px 0;
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 28px;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        li {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333333;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .card-box {
            background: #fff8f0;
            border-left: 5px solid #ef8805;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        a {
            color: #ef8805;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: underline;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        a:hover {
            color: #d17400;
        }
        .contact-card {
            background: #ef8805;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .contact-card h2 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .contact-card h2::before {
            display: none;
        }
        .contact-card p, .contact-card a {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header-brand">
        <div class="logo-badge">MAGIS TV</div>
        <div>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <div class="date">Effective Date: November 17, 2026</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-box">
        <strong>Magis TV</strong> (Package: <code>com.magistvllc.pelicalus</code>) respects and protects your privacy. This policy outlines our data handling practices and our commitment to transparency.
    </div>

    <h2>1. Information We Do NOT Collect</h2>
    <p>Magis TV operates without user account registration. We do <strong>NOT</strong> collect, store, or share any personal identity data, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your real name, home address, or phone number</li>
        <li>Financial, payment, or credit card details</li>
        <li>Precise GPS location data</li>
        <li>Contacts, photos, or personal files stored on your device</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
    <p>To deliver movie information, video streaming, and display advertisements, Magis TV integrates third-party services. These partners may collect device identifiers (such as Google Advertising ID / AAID) and standard diagnostic data in accordance with their privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Google Play Services:</strong><br>
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Google AdMob:</strong><br>
            <a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>AppLovin:</strong><br>
            <a href="https://www.applovin.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.applovin.com/privacy/</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Meta (Facebook Audience Network):</strong><br>
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/about/privacy/update" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.facebook.com/about/privacy/update</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>The Movie Database (TMDb):</strong><br>
            <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.themoviedb.org/privacy-policy</a>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Device Permissions</h2>
    <p>Magis TV only requests standard Android network permissions necessary for core streaming features:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>android.permission.INTERNET</code>: Required to load movie catalogs and stream content.</li>
        <li><code>android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE</code>: Used to check internet connection status.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Children’s Privacy (COPPA & GDPR)</h2>
    <p>Magis TV is not directed to children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under 13. If you believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately so we can promptly take appropriate action.</p>

    <h2>5. Security</h2>
    <p>We value your trust in using Magis TV. We employ industry-standard security practices to protect user interactions and ensure a secure entertainment experience.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy periodically. We encourage you to review this page from time to time for any updates. Changes take effect immediately upon being posted.</p>

    <div class="contact-card">
        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions, inquiries, or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our support team at:</p>
        <p>📧 Email: <a href="mailto:info@magistv.com">info@magistv.com</a></p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
